Extend Dermux keybar with touch-first keyboard behavior and hardcoded layout rendering.

This patch introduces:
1. Android-friendly keybar lifecycle, visibility, and IME controls.
2. Sticky modifiers with explicit visual states.
3. Hardcoded EN/RU/Fn/Caps keyboard rows with variable-width keys.
4. Pointer gesture routing with swipe support for key actions.
5. Focus-safe command/key dispatch for browser editor workflows.

